<title>CHINA: China exports 70,000 tonnes of corn in Jan-Feb.</title>
<headline>China exports 70,000 tonnes of corn in Jan-Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 70,000 tonnes of corn in the first two months of this year, customs figures showed on Tuesday. No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>China halted corn exports in late 1994 amid soaring domestic prices.</p>
<p>China's corn imports were zero in January and February, compared with imports of 370,000 tonnes in the year-ago two months, the customs figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
